These assert statements are generated from the csharp code provided. Note that `Debug.Assert` method typically checks a condition at run time and if the condition becomes false, then the program throws an AssertionFailedException. In this case, the checks are done to ensure that some invariant (properties of data or system state) is maintained after some operation.--------------------